From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yash Vaibhav Awasthi <132498904+Yash-Awasthi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:29:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] target/riscv: attn_core.h, attn_abi.h: add the SPDX
 licence line

Without this patch the two headers carry no licence identifier, so a downstream copy cannot tell what terms they are under. The patch adds the SPDX-License-Identifier line to target/riscv/attn_core.h and target/riscv/attn_abi.h and changes nothing else.

Tested with scripts/patches.sh check: the patch applies with git apply --check at the pinned 615ece3c406b, the series re-applies to the same tree and the export matches. The line is visible in both files after apply.

Signed-off-by: Yash Vaibhav Awasthi <132498904+Yash-Awasthi@users.noreply.github.com>

Upstream review list: qemu-devel@nongnu.org (qemu/docs/devel/submitting-a-patch.rst). Submitted: no.
---
 target/riscv/attn_abi.h  | 1 +
 target/riscv/attn_core.h | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/target/riscv/attn_abi.h b/target/riscv/attn_abi.h
index b31582d..2cff5d2 100644
--- a/target/riscv/attn_abi.h
+++ b/target/riscv/attn_abi.h
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later */
 /* attn_abi.h -- architectural interface of the RISC-V Xattn extension.
 
    One instruction computes a complete multi-head self-attention block:
diff --git a/target/riscv/attn_core.h b/target/riscv/attn_core.h
index 8501d14..37ef8dd 100644
--- a/target/riscv/attn_core.h
+++ b/target/riscv/attn_core.h
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later */
 /* attn_core.h -- the one executable definition of the attn instruction.
 
    Included unchanged by the Spike and QEMU execution models and by the host
